---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="apps | Tom Frodyma"
  description="The apps I built: MailMate, IPM, Skillsloop, and Tophe."
>
  <h1 class="sr-only">Apps</h1>
  <p><span class="nick">&lt;tom&gt;</span> level select: the apps I built.</p>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">MailMate</h2>
    <p class="status">
      <span class="ok">live</span>,
      <span class="dim">50+ people use it daily</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      An AI agent that drafts emails for customer service teams. I rolled it out
      to Change's clients, trained everyone, and still tune it on their
      feedback.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">IPM</h2>
    <p class="status">
      <span class="ok">live</span>,
      <span class="dim">Marktplaats, hollandsnieuwe, Eneco eMobility</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      An AI quality-management tool. I redesigned and shipped its complete
      frontend with AI-assisted development.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">Skillsloop</h2>
    <p class="status">
      <span class="warn">pilot</span>,
      <span class="dim">two POCs</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      An AI role-play app where support agents practice realistic customer
      conversations. I took it from idea to working product.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">Tophe</h2>
    <p class="status"><span class="ok">open source</span></p>
    <p>
      A personal project, free and open source. Try it at
      <a href="https://tophe.app">tophe.app</a> or read the code on
      <a href="https://github.com/TomFrodyma/tophe">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  h2.frame-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  h2.frame-title::before {
    content: none;
  }

  .status {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .frame p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
